#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:4007
msgid ""
"The language a magazine gets when it is added. It is written into the "
"metadata of every issue (the opf file and the pdf), so readers and Calibre "
"show the right language."
msgstr ""
"Jazyk, ktorý časopis dostane pri pridaní. Zapíše sa do metadát každého čísla "
