#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:4107
msgid ""
"LazyLibrarian has the ability to send basic information about the "
"installation, how it is configured, and how it is used to a server. This "
"helps the developers figure out how it is used, where it is worth improving, "
"and which parts nobody uses."
